name: Saved seven-scope response drives twenty-one fixed native jobs and Report
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_replay_native.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false}
require-live-snap: 40 context:build indexed 602 files | source-context
submit: use threat-model
submit: options threat-model:import
submit: set path .kuzushi/replay-context.json
submit: set activate false
submit: set label Owned scope response replay
submit: run threat-model:import
require-live-snap: 30 threat-model:import saved | manual-context
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | map-review
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks semgrep
paste-file: @ART/rule-setting.txt
keys: Enter
paste-file: @ART/scanner-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set semgrepTimeoutMs 60000
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 Enter / c build inventory | no-scope
keys: c
require-live-snap: 35 DRAFT SCOPES | initial-inventory
expect: all: 3 jobs
keys: Enter /
type: Suggest scan scopes with AI
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ Suggest scan scopes with AI | proposal-action
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 AI SCOPE PRIORITIES | proposal-priorities
paste-file: @ART/priorities.txt
keys: F2
require-live-snap: 25 SUGGEST SCAN SCOPES | proposal-plan
keys: t
type: 3
keys: Enter r
type: 2
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | proposal-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_replay_native.py @TMP_TARGET @ART proposal-draft
keys: Enter End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | proposal-approval
expect: 1 fixed jobs
expect: Total provider calls: 3
expect: Protected review calls: 2
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Open approved scope proposal job | approved-proposal
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 L starts the approved jobs | proposal-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | proposal-running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_replay_native.py @TMP_TARGET @ART proposal-finished
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | proposal-completed
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 Review suggested scopes | proposal-result
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Shared allowance: calls 1/3 | replayed-boundaries
expect: DRAFT SCOPES
expect: all: 21 jobs
expect: Shared allowance: calls 1/3
expect: 2 Review protected
ask: Does the saved-response replay enter the ordinary unaccepted scope reader with seven primary boundaries, shared context, retained spending and separate future approval?
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Accept exact boundaries | boundary-approval
keys: Enter End Enter
require-live-snap: 30 ACCEPTED SCOPES | accepted-boundaries
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_replay_native.py @TMP_TARGET @ART accepted
keys: Home Space Down Space Down Space Down Space Down Space Down Space Down Space
require-live-snap: 20 7 boundaries marked | seven-marked
keys: p
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | fixed-study
expect: 21 fixed discovery jobs
expect: 1 committed / 3 total
ask: Does the scan draft preserve the proposal's existing allowance and freeze twenty-one jobs with one worker, without discovering shared files again through each consumer?
keys: L
require-live-snap: 35 Scope draft ready | scan-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_replay_native.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scan-draft
keys: L Home
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | scan-approval
expect: 21 fixed jobs
expect: Total provider calls: 3
expect: Protected review calls: 2
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | scan-approval-tail
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved-scan
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | scan-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | scan-running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_replay_native.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 21 completed | completed-jobs
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Scan | scan-result
expect-not: · failed ·
expect-not: findings 23
ask: Does the first Scan frame show complete receipts or an honest pending state, without converting a running indexed summary into a failed engine or presenting incomplete aggregate totals?
require-live-snap: 25 21/21 complete | settled-scan
expect: findings 8 distinct
nav-mode:
keys: n
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | accepted-scan
paste-file: @ART/open-control-panel.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 unit_095.ts | panel-finding
submit: decision deferred Benign replay marker owner review
paste-file: @ART/open-gateway.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 services/gateway | gateway-finding
submit: decision deferred Benign replay marker owner review
paste-file: @ART/open-accounts.txt
