keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 services/invoicing | invoicing-finding
submit: decision deferred Benign replay marker owner review
paste-file: @ART/open-worker.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 services/worker | worker-finding
submit: decision deferred Benign replay marker owner review
paste-file: @ART/open-notifications.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 services/notifications | notifications-finding
submit: decision deferred Benign replay marker owner review
paste-file: @ART/open-loose.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 loose.py | root-finding
submit: decision deferred Benign replay marker owner review
paste-file: @ART/open-shared.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 message_07.json | shared-finding
submit: decision deferred Benign replay marker owner review
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set semgrepConfig p/unrelated-current
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Scope study: | report
expect: 7 boundaries
expect: 1 committed / 3 calls
expect: 2 protected review remaining
ask: Does Report retain seven boundaries, eight benign signals and three-pass recurrence while distinguishing rule-selected coverage and unavailable charges from complete security coverage?
